<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:camunda="http://camunda.org/schema/1.0/bpmn" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" xmlns:modeler="http://camunda.org/schema/modeler/1.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" id="Definitions_tobacco_free_nicotine_product_sales" targetNamespace="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn" exporter="Camunda Modeler" exporterVersion="5.33.1" modeler:executionPlatform="Camunda Platform" modeler:executionPlatformVersion="7.20.0">
  <!-- One message per manual phase exit. The user interface correlates these on the business key of the instance, i.e. the errand id. -->
  <bpmn:message id="message_registration_completed" name="registration_completed" />
  <bpmn:message id="message_review_completed" name="review_completed" />
  <bpmn:message id="message_follow_up_completed" name="follow_up_completed" />
  <bpmn:message id="message_closure_completed" name="closure_completed" />
  <bpmn:message id="message_process_cancelled" name="process_cancelled" />
  <bpmn:error id="error_step_skipped" name="Step skipped" errorCode="step_skipped" />
  <bpmn:process id="tobacco-free-nicotine-product-sales" name="PROCESS Sale of tobacco-free nicotine products" isExecutable="true" camunda:historyTimeToLive="P30D">
    <bpmn:documentation>Skeleton of the process. A notification from the e-service passes Registration through Decision without a case worker. One a case worker created waits in Registration until the case worker completes it. In Timrå every notification waits in Review until the case worker completes it and the errand has a case number from the records of Timrå. Follow up and Closure wait for a case worker to move the errand on through the user interface; the activities within a phase are added as the business logic is implemented.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="start_process" name="Start process">
      <bpmn:documentation>The start of the process execution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_start_process_to_registration</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_start_process_to_registration" sourceRef="start_process" targetRef="registration_phase" />
    <bpmn:subProcess id="registration_phase" name="Registration">
      <bpmn:documentation>Registers the errand and the material it arrived with.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_start_process_to_registration</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_registration_to_review</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="start_registration_phase" name="Start registration phase">
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_registration_start_to_create_submission_pdf</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_registration_start_to_create_submission_pdf" sourceRef="start_registration_phase" targetRef="external_task_create_submission_pdf" />
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="external_task_create_submission_pdf" name="Create submission PDF" camunda:type="external" camunda:topic="CreateSubmissionPdfTask">
        <bpmn:documentation>Saves the submission the errand came in with as a PDF on the errand, so it can be entered in the records. The form comes from the first JSON parameter of the errand and its schema in json-schema. An errand that did not come in through the e-service has no submission, and the step is skipped. An errand from the e-service without JSON parameters raises an incident.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_registration_start_to_create_submission_pdf</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_registration_create_submission_pdf_to_end</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_registration_create_submission_pdf_to_end" sourceRef="external_task_create_submission_pdf" targetRef="end_registration_phase" />
      <bpmn:boundaryEvent id="boundary_create_submission_pdf_skipped" name="No submission" attachedToRef="external_task_create_submission_pdf">
        <bpmn:documentation>Takes the process past the step for an errand that did not come in through the e-service. A case worker created that errand, so it waits for the case worker to complete the registration.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_registration_submission_pdf_skipped_to_await</bpmn:outgoing>
        <bpmn:errorEventDefinition id="errordef_create_submission_pdf_skipped" errorRef="error_step_skipped" />
      </bpmn:boundaryEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_registration_submission_pdf_skipped_to_await" sourceRef="boundary_create_submission_pdf_skipped" targetRef="await_registration_completed" />
      <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="await_registration_completed" name="Registration completed">
        <bpmn:documentation>Waits until a case worker marks the registration as completed in the user interface, so a notification the case worker created is complete before it is decided. The phase stays in the activity tree while it waits, so the interface can show where the errand is.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_registration_submission_pdf_skipped_to_await</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_registration_await_to_end</bpmn:outgoing>
        <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="messagedef_registration_completed" messageRef="message_registration_completed" />
      </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_registration_await_to_end" sourceRef="await_registration_completed" targetRef="end_registration_phase" />
      <bpmn:endEvent id="end_registration_phase" name="End registration phase">
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_registration_create_submission_pdf_to_end</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_registration_await_to_end</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_registration_to_review" sourceRef="registration_phase" targetRef="review_phase" />
    <bpmn:subProcess id="review_phase" name="Review">
      <bpmn:documentation>Checks that the errand is complete enough to be investigated.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_registration_to_review</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_review_to_investigation</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="start_review_phase" name="Start review phase">
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_review_start_to_check_premises_municipality</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_review_start_to_check_premises_municipality" sourceRef="start_review_phase" targetRef="external_task_check_premises_municipality" />
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="external_task_check_premises_municipality" name="Check premises municipality" camunda:type="external" camunda:topic="CheckPremisesMunicipalityTask">
        <bpmn:documentation>Reads the municipality of the premises from the errand and sets premisesMunicipalityId.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_review_start_to_check_premises_municipality</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_review_check_premises_municipality_to_gateway</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_review_check_premises_municipality_to_gateway" sourceRef="external_task_check_premises_municipality" targetRef="gateway_premises_municipality" />
      <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="gateway_premises_municipality" name="Premises municipality">
        <bpmn:documentation>Sundsvall reviews a notification without a case worker. Timrå waits for the case worker and for the case number from its records.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_review_check_premises_municipality_to_gateway</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_review_gateway_to_end</bpmn:outgoing>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_review_gateway_to_await</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_review_gateway_to_end" name="Sundsvall" sourceRef="gateway_premises_municipality" targetRef="end_review_phase">
        <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">${premisesMunicipalityId != '2262'}</bpmn:conditionExpression>
      </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_review_gateway_to_await" name="Timrå" sourceRef="gateway_premises_municipality" targetRef="await_review_completed">
        <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">${premisesMunicipalityId == '2262'}</bpmn:conditionExpression>
      </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
      <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="await_review_completed" name="Review completed">
        <bpmn:documentation>Waits until a case worker marks the review as completed in the user interface. The phase stays in the activity tree while it waits, so the interface can show where the errand is.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_review_gateway_to_await</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_review_case_number_missing_to_await</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_review_await_to_check_case_number</bpmn:outgoing>
        <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="messagedef_review_completed" messageRef="message_review_completed" />
      </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_review_await_to_check_case_number" sourceRef="await_review_completed" targetRef="external_task_check_case_number" />
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="external_task_check_case_number" name="Check case number" camunda:type="external" camunda:topic="CheckCaseNumberTask">
        <bpmn:documentation>Checks that an errand in Timrå has a case number from the records of Timrå in timraCaseNumber and sets caseNumberAccepted. Without one the case worker is warned in the activity log.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_review_await_to_check_case_number</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_review_check_case_number_to_gateway</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_review_check_case_number_to_gateway" sourceRef="external_task_check_case_number" targetRef="gateway_case_number_accepted" />
      <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="gateway_case_number_accepted" name="Case number accepted?">
        <bpmn:documentation>Without a case number the process goes back to wait for the case worker, who fills it in and completes the review again, instead of stopping on an incident.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_review_check_case_number_to_gateway</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_review_case_number_accepted_to_end</bpmn:outgoing>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_review_case_number_missing_to_await</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_review_case_number_accepted_to_end" name="Accepted" sourceRef="gateway_case_number_accepted" targetRef="end_review_phase">
        <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">${caseNumberAccepted}</bpmn:conditionExpression>
      </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_review_case_number_missing_to_await" name="Missing" sourceRef="gateway_case_number_accepted" targetRef="await_review_completed">
        <bpmn:conditionExpression xsi:type="bpmn:tFormalExpression">${!caseNumberAccepted}</bpmn:conditionExpression>
      </bpmn:sequenceFlow>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="end_review_phase" name="End review phase">
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_review_gateway_to_end</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_review_case_number_accepted_to_end</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_review_to_investigation" sourceRef="review_phase" targetRef="investigation_phase" />
    <bpmn:subProcess id="investigation_phase" name="Investigation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Gathers the referrals and the information the decision needs.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_review_to_investigation</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_investigation_to_decision</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="start_investigation_phase" name="Start investigation phase">
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_investigation_start_to_end</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_investigation_start_to_end" sourceRef="start_investigation_phase" targetRef="end_investigation_phase" />
      <bpmn:endEvent id="end_investigation_phase" name="End investigation phase">
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_investigation_start_to_end</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_investigation_to_decision" sourceRef="investigation_phase" targetRef="decision_phase" />
    <bpmn:subProcess id="decision_phase" name="Decision">
      <bpmn:documentation>Records the decision taken on the errand.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_investigation_to_decision</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_decision_to_follow_up</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="start_decision_phase" name="Start decision phase">
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_decision_start_to_create_decision</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_decision_start_to_create_decision" sourceRef="start_decision_phase" targetRef="external_task_create_decision" />
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="external_task_create_decision" name="Create decision" camunda:type="external" camunda:topic="CreateDecisionTask">
        <bpmn:documentation>Approves the notification with a completed decision that carries every attachment of the errand but the submission PDF.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_decision_start_to_create_decision</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_decision_create_decision_to_create_asset</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_decision_create_decision_to_create_asset" sourceRef="external_task_create_decision" targetRef="external_task_create_asset" />
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="external_task_create_asset" name="Create asset" camunda:type="external" camunda:topic="CreateAssetTask">
        <bpmn:documentation>Creates the permit in party-assets from the decision.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_decision_create_decision_to_create_asset</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_decision_create_asset_to_end</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_decision_create_asset_to_end" sourceRef="external_task_create_asset" targetRef="end_decision_phase" />
      <bpmn:endEvent id="end_decision_phase" name="End decision phase">
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_decision_create_asset_to_end</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_decision_to_follow_up" sourceRef="decision_phase" targetRef="follow_up_phase" />
    <bpmn:subProcess id="follow_up_phase" name="Follow up">
      <bpmn:documentation>Follows up the decision and the conditions it carries.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_decision_to_follow_up</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_follow_up_to_closure</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="start_follow_up_phase" name="Start follow up phase">
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_follow_up_start_to_await</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_follow_up_start_to_await" sourceRef="start_follow_up_phase" targetRef="await_follow_up_completed" />
      <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="await_follow_up_completed" name="Follow up completed">
        <bpmn:documentation>Waits until a case worker marks the follow up as completed in the user interface. The phase stays in the activity tree while it waits, so the interface can show where the errand is.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_follow_up_start_to_await</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_follow_up_await_to_end</bpmn:outgoing>
        <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="messagedef_follow_up_completed" messageRef="message_follow_up_completed" />
      </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_follow_up_await_to_end" sourceRef="await_follow_up_completed" targetRef="end_follow_up_phase" />
      <bpmn:endEvent id="end_follow_up_phase" name="End follow up phase">
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_follow_up_await_to_end</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_follow_up_to_closure" sourceRef="follow_up_phase" targetRef="closure_phase" />
    <bpmn:subProcess id="closure_phase" name="Closure">
      <bpmn:documentation>Closes the errand.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_follow_up_to_closure</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_closure_to_complete_process</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="start_closure_phase" name="Start closure phase">
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_closure_start_to_await</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_closure_start_to_await" sourceRef="start_closure_phase" targetRef="await_closure_completed" />
      <bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent id="await_closure_completed" name="Closure completed">
        <bpmn:documentation>Waits until a case worker marks the errand as closed in the user interface. The phase stays in the activity tree while it waits, so the interface can show where the errand is.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_closure_start_to_await</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_closure_await_to_end</bpmn:outgoing>
        <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="messagedef_closure_completed" messageRef="message_closure_completed" />
      </bpmn:intermediateCatchEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_closure_await_to_end" sourceRef="await_closure_completed" targetRef="end_closure_phase" />
      <bpmn:endEvent id="end_closure_phase" name="End closure phase">
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_closure_await_to_end</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_closure_to_complete_process" sourceRef="closure_phase" targetRef="external_task_complete_process" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="external_task_complete_process" name="Complete process" camunda:type="external" camunda:topic="CompleteProcessTask">
      <bpmn:documentation>Reports the process as completed to Support Management. A branch that ends without this step leaves the errand on a row saying RUNNING for good.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_closure_to_complete_process</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_complete_process_to_end_process</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_complete_process_to_end_process" sourceRef="external_task_complete_process" targetRef="end_process" />
    <bpmn:endEvent id="end_process" name="End process">
      <bpmn:documentation>The end of the process execution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_complete_process_to_end_process</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="cancel_process_subprocess" name="Cancellation" triggeredByEvent="true">
      <bpmn:documentation>Cancels the process in whatever phase it stands, e.g. when the applicant withdraws the errand. The phase or work step that runs is interrupted.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="cancel_process" name="Process cancelled">
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_cancel_process_to_cancel_task</bpmn:outgoing>
        <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="messagedef_cancel_process" messageRef="message_process_cancelled" />
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_cancel_process_to_cancel_task" sourceRef="cancel_process" targetRef="external_task_cancel_process" />
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="external_task_cancel_process" name="Cancel process" camunda:type="external" camunda:topic="CancelProcessTask">
        <bpmn:documentation>Reports the process as completed to Support Management, which closes the process life of the errand: no new process is started for it.</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_cancel_process_to_cancel_task</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>flow_cancel_task_to_end</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_cancel_task_to_end" sourceRef="external_task_cancel_process" targetRef="end_process_cancelled" />
      <bpmn:endEvent id="end_process_cancelled" name="End cancelled process">
        <bpmn:incoming>flow_cancel_task_to_end</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="BPMNDiagram_tobacco_free_nicotine_product_sales">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="BPMNPlane_tobacco_free_nicotine_product_sales" bpmnElement="tobacco-free-nicotine-product-sales">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_start_process" bpmnElement="start_process">
        <dc:Bounds x="152" y="99" width="36" height="36" />
        <bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
          <dc:Bounds x="141" y="142" width="61" height="14" />
        </bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_registration_phase" bpmnElement="registration_phase" isExpanded="false">
        <dc:Bounds x="240" y="77" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_review_phase" bpmnElement="review_phase" isExpanded="false">
        <dc:Bounds x="390" y="77" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_investigation_phase" bpmnElement="investigation_phase" isExpanded="false">
        <dc:Bounds x="540" y="77" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_decision_phase" bpmnElement="decision_phase" isExpanded="false">
        <dc:Bounds x="690" y="77" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_follow_up_phase" bpmnElement="follow_up_phase" isExpanded="false">
        <dc:Bounds x="840" y="77" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_closure_phase" bpmnElement="closure_phase" isExpanded="false">
        <dc:Bounds x="990" y="77" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_end_process" bpmnElement="end_process">
        <dc:Bounds x="1292" y="99" width="36" height="36" />
        <bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
          <dc:Bounds x="1283" y="142" width="55" height="14" />
        </bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="BPMNEdge_flow_start_process_to_registration" bpmnElement="flow_start_process_to_registration">
        <di:waypoint x="188" y="117" />
        <di:waypoint x="240" y="117" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="BPMNEdge_flow_registration_to_review" bpmnElement="flow_registration_to_review">
        <di:waypoint x="340" y="117" />
        <di:waypoint x="390" y="117" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="BPMNEdge_flow_review_to_investigation" bpmnElement="flow_review_to_investigation">
        <di:waypoint x="490" y="117" />
        <di:waypoint x="540" y="117" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="BPMNEdge_flow_investigation_to_decision" bpmnElement="flow_investigation_to_decision">
        <di:waypoint x="640" y="117" />
        <di:waypoint x="690" y="117" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="BPMNEdge_flow_decision_to_follow_up" bpmnElement="flow_decision_to_follow_up">
        <di:waypoint x="790" y="117" />
        <di:waypoint x="840" y="117" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="BPMNEdge_flow_follow_up_to_closure" bpmnElement="flow_follow_up_to_closure">
        <di:waypoint x="940" y="117" />
        <di:waypoint x="990" y="117" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_external_task_complete_process" bpmnElement="external_task_complete_process">
        <dc:Bounds x="1140" y="77" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
